# Camera Capture (Android)

Use `camera.photo` for standalone high-quality capture, not `stream.capturePhoto()`. Stop Stream first; accessing Photo starts it lazily. Wait for `PhotoState.STARTED`, then capture and observe data, progress, and errors. Stop Photo before Camera. Requires camera permission and is experimental.
